<title>USA: Euphonix CFO Chew resigns.</title>
<headline>Euphonix CFO Chew resigns.</headline>
<dateline>PALO ALTO, Calif 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Euphonix Inc said Jeffrey Chew, vice president of finance and chief financial officer has resigned to pursue an opportunity outside the audio industry.</p>
<p>Euphonix is seeking a replacement for this position.</p>
</text>
